OL,3,GNEWSA'World-class' Agatha Christie
OL,4,Acentre planned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "world-class visitor attraction"
OL,7,Fcelebrating bestselling author Agatha
OL,8,FChristie's life and work is planned for
OL,9,FDevon.
OL,11,FTorbay Council said it hopes to turn
OL,12,Fthe historic Torquay Pavilion into a
OL,13,F"nationally significant cultural
OL,14,Fdestination" dedicated to the woman
OL,15,Foften referred to as the Queen of
OL,16,FCrime.
OL,18,FThe creator of characters including
OL,19,FMiss Marple and Hercule Poirot was born
OL,20,Fin Torquay in 1890 and later had a
OL,21,Ffamily home nearby at Greenway,
OL,22,Foverlooking the River Dart.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
